OL,3,GNEWSAI do not have confidence UK is
OL,4,Asafe from Russian threats - Swinney
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst Minister John Swinney says he
OL,7,Fdoes not have confidence the UK is safe
OL,8,Ffrom potential Russian threats.
OL,10,FThe SNP leader said the UK government,
OL,11,Fwhich is in charge of Britain's
OL,12,Fdefences, did not have a sufficient
OL,13,F"presence" in vulnerable areas off
OL,14,FScotland's coast.
OL,16,FHe said he was "very worried" by
OL,17,Fsecurity fears highlighted this week by
OL,18,Fthe head of MI5, Sir Ken McCallum, who
OL,19,Fnamed Russia as "aggressor number one".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
