OL,3,GNEWSAI do not have confidence UK is
OL,4,Asafe from Russian threats - Swinney
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to BBC Scotland News ahead of
OL,7,Fthe SNP's annual conference, Swinney
OL,8,Falso denied that independence would
OL,9,Fweaken Scotland's security.
